{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>that is not speckled and spotted.</b> Speckled and piebald and ringed." "<b>among the goats.</b> Males and females."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra is distinguishing three terms: נקוד (speckled), ברוד (piebald/mottled), and עקוד (ringed/banded), apparently clarizing the range of markings implied."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:26.256324444Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}